unce his presence.<\/li><li><b>On the screen, he spots the different logos and names of the companies <\/b>he can contact.<\/li><li><b>He scrolls through them if necessary and clicks on the one he wants.<\/b>\u00a0The call starts immediately.<\/li><li><b>Remotely, the host receives the call: <\/b>he sees the place of origin of the call and the requested company.<\/li><li><b>When he responds, a video and audio conversation begins <\/b>between the two interlocutors.<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6502094d e-con-full e-flex wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no e-con e-child\" data-id=\"6502094d\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-426d94ee elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"426d94ee\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/www.interactivedisplays.ie\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/reception-2.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-1378\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.interactivedisplays.ie\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/reception-2.png 600w, https:\/\/www.interactivedisplays.ie\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/reception-2-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/www.interactivedisplays.ie\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/reception-2-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/www.interactivedisplays.ie\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/reception-2-100x100.png 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div id=\"e-n-tab-content-14249901714\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"e-n-tab-title-14249901714\" data-tab-index=\"4\" style=\"--n-tabs-title-order: 4;\" class=\" elementor-element elementor-element-d92f51c e-con-full e-flex wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no e-con e-child\" data-id=\"d92f51c\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-46723eb2 e-con-full e-flex wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no e-con e-child\" data-id=\"46723eb2\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3e5d2a95 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"3e5d2a95\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">Photo &amp; Badges<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5cfbbb7b elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5cfbbb7b\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<ul><li>As soon as he arrives, the visitor goes to the <strong>kiosks positioned in self-service<\/strong>\u00a0in order to\u00a0<strong>carry out his pre-registration<\/strong>.<\/li><li>By selecting a purpose of visit that requires a badge, the visitor <strong>receives a ticket with a bar-code<\/strong>, and he is invited to go to the photo taking area.<\/li><li>Scanning the QRCode triggers the <strong>photo software<\/strong>.<\/li><li>He takes the photo and sees the result (he has 3 tries). He validates the photo shoot.<\/li><li>A message informs him that <strong>he can return to wait<\/strong>.<\/li><li>He is repositioned in the queue where <strong>he can be called by reception.<\/strong><\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5aa35893 e-con-full e-flex wpr-particle-no wpr-jarallax-no wpr-parallax-no wpr-sticky-section-no e-con e-child\" data-id=\"5aa35893\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<d